title: 개강총회_영문
---
<<bg 개강총회>>
(Today is the first day of the spring semester...)
(Since I recently joined the game development club this semester,)
(I attended the club's general meeting after all my classes were over.)
(After a brief round of introductions and a presentation of the club's schedule,)
(We moved to a place for the welcome party.)
(I introduced myself to the three girls sitting at my table.)
<<show hyun_idle>>
NaHyun: Hi, I'm NaHyun Yang, Class of '24.
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: I'm EunPyo Seo, Class of '24!
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: Oh, h-hello. I'm ASan Shin, Class of '22.
<<hide>>
I'm also from the Class of '22.
(We shared a conversation.)
(As we talked, we became somewhat close and decided to speak more comfortably to each other.)
<<show hyun_idle>>
NaHyun: Do you live alone near campus?
(I do live alone. To say yes, let's nod.)
<<choice 개강총회_긍정_영문 "Yeah" 개강총회_긍정_영문 "Yeah">>
===

title: 개강총회_긍정_영문
---
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: Oh, me too. Are you living near the *** Officetel area?
(I don't live near there. To say no, let's shake our head.)
<<choice 개강총회_부정_영문 "No" 개강총회_부정_영문 "No">>
===

title: 개강총회_부정_영문
---
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: I'm quite envious that you live by yourself...
<<show pyo_neg>>
EunPyo: Hey, we agreed to speak comfortably~
<<show san_neg>>
ASan: Ah, right... I'm so sor— sorry...
<<hide>>
(We talked much more than I expected.)
(All three of them seem like charming and cute friends in their own unique ways.)
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: I think I'll have to take a leave of absence next semester because I have to work as an intern.
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: An internship? That's so cool!
<<show hyun_idle>>
NaHyun: I'm going on an exchange program next semester too.
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: Actually, next semester, I... I'm...
<<show pyo_blush>>
EunPyo: (Blushing)... Never mind.
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: What?! Now I'm curious.
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: Oh, stop it... It's a secret... Anyway, I'm planning to take a break from school too...
<<hide>>
(It seems like everyone won't be around next semester.)
(Does that mean I only have this one semester to spend time with them?!)
(The welcome party wound down,)
(And we added each other on the EveryClass timetable app, promising to say hi if we ran into each other on campus.)
<<end>>
